The `run` fn (lines 54-136) demonstrates casting a callee to `AnyJsMemberExpression` and reading `member_name()` / `object()` — directly relevant to a `.length` member check.

### (b) `UseConsistentBuiltinInstantiation` — uses the semantic model, Unsafe fix, `State` payload
`/workspace/repo/crates/biome_js_analyze/src/lint/nursery/use_consistent_builtin_instantiation.rs`

Imports + query using the semantic model (lines 1-118):
```rust
